e, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "hardware": {"system_ram": "128254", "os": "Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition)", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen Threadripper 7960X 24-Cores          ", "adapter_description": "AMD AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (radeonsi, navi31, LLVM 21.1.8, DRM 3.64, 6.19.12-200.fc43.x86_64)", "vram_size": 20480}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223866650", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048867445", "personaname": "CosmicJosh", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048867445/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 6837, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1315, "last_played": 1789264129, "avatar": "59282ad58ffce592059c9c87b47874a9cc53b143"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very silly rouge-like where you play as a crab with a gun. Supports multiplayer, has a little bit of depth and variety and can support a good handful of playthroughs. The balance isn't perfect though, and I've found that critical chance upgrades are pretty much the winning play, as are the black-hole grenades. For a game with a good amount of variety, it's too bad that I won't use most of these weapons more than once or so.\n\nIt's not going to keep people coming back for hundreds of hours, but it's a really satisfying time when the build comes together and has provided two of my different friend groups with plenty of laughs. \n\nI'm very curious to hear if there's ever to be a full release, but at $10, it's hard to complain.", "timestamp_created": 1776887975, "timestamp_updated": 1776888207, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223836168", "author": {"steamid": "76561198796222440", "personaname": "EloX07", "persona